                                                "sense_id": "bcebd415-e329-35cc-94ba-e86f4bc91fc0",
                                                "text": "The MoD said the injured men received immediate medical attention and were evacuated by air to the military hospital at Camp Bastion, but three could not be saved. Next of kin have been informed. The other soldiers hurt are not thought to have life-threatening injures."
                                            },
